        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Winstone, Ben Kingsley, Ian McShane\n- Films: Cold Mountain, Nil By Mouth, King Arthur, The Magic Roundabout, The Departed, Beowulf, Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, Edge of Darkness, The Sweeney, Noah, Sexy Beast, Doogal, The Lord of the Springs\n- Television series: The Magic Roundabout\n- Places: France, the United States\n\nFacts:\n- The Magic Roundabout is a 2005 French-British computer-animated adventure fantasy film based on the television series The Magic Roundabout.\n- The Magic Roundabout was released in France as Pollux - Le manège enchanté.\n- The Magic Roundabout was redubbed in the United States as Doogal or The Lord of the Springs.\n- Sexy Beast stars Ray Winstone, Ben Kingsley, and Ian McShane.\n- Ray Winstone has appeared in the films Cold Mountain, Nil By Mouth, King Arthur, The Magic Roundabout, The Departed, Beowulf, Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, Edge of Darkness, The Sweeney, and Noah.",
